*  CONTROL, GREEN -- a DEFINE'd proc that RETURNs with no goto at all.  Proves the RETURN
*  pop-pair glue is sound on its own; the igt_ family's red needs the COMPUTED goto.
        DEFINE('f()')                   :(fmain)
f       OUTPUT = 'in f'                 :(RETURN)
fmain   f()
        OUTPUT = 'back'                 :(END)
END
